#: ../../zh/triton_api/Debug_Ops/static_assert.md:5
msgid "`static_assert` 用于在编译时断言条件是否成立，如果条件不满足则编译失败。这是一个编译时检查工具，不需要设置调试环境变量。"
msgstr ""
"`static_assert` is used to assert whether a condition holds at compile time;"
" if the condition is not met, compilation fails. This is a compile-time "
"checking tool that does not require setting debug environment variables."

